@lesson T1.01 "Film & TV Vocabulary"

@word de Film = the movie
@word d'Tëlee = the TV
@word de Fernsee = the television
@word de Kino = the cinema
@word de Schauspiller = the actor
@word d'Schauspillerin = the actress
@word de Regisseur = the director
@word d'Ënnertitelen = the subtitles
@word d'Sprooch = the language
@word de Genre = the genre
@word d'Serie = the series
@word den Documentaire = the documentary
@word d'Noriichten = the news
@word d'Reklamm = the advertisement
@word d'Seance = the screening
@word d'DVD = the DVD
@word d'Plattform = the platform
@word den Internet = the internet
@word de Kanal = the channel
@word d'Filmkritik = the film review
@word de Filmfestival = the film festival
@word de Museksvideo = the music video
@word d'Bewäertung = the rating
@word den Inhalt = the content
@word aschalten = to turn on
@word ausschalten = to turn off

@sentence
@lu Ech kucke Filmer um Internet a bal ni op DVD.
@en I watch movies on the internet and almost never on DVD.
@distractor-lu Kino
@distractor-lu Reklamm
@distractor-en cinema
@distractor-en advertisement

@sentence
@lu Ech kucken d'Noriichten op Englesch.
@en I watch the news in English.
@distractor-lu Sprooch
@distractor-lu Kino
@distractor-en language
@distractor-en cinema

@sentence
@lu Ech maachen eng Paus, wann d'Reklamm kënnt.
@en I take a break when the advertisement comes.
@distractor-lu Kanal
@distractor-lu Film
@distractor-en channel
@distractor-en movie

@sentence
@lu De Kino ass flott, mee och e bëssen deier.
@en The cinema is nice, but also a bit expensive.
@distractor-lu bequeem
@distractor-lu Internet
@distractor-en convenient
@distractor-en internet

@sentence
@lu Ech streame Serien op enger Plattform.
@en I stream series on a platform.
@distractor-lu Tëlee
@distractor-lu Kino
@distractor-en television
@distractor-en cinema
